# RouteFoundry bundled task suite v1 - auto-gradable only.
# Every item is graded deterministically, so the suite measures verifiable short-answer
# ability rather than open-ended generation quality. Difficulty is spread on purpose:
# if every model scores the same, routing has nothing to learn.
